WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:15.620
In this video we bring you the breaking news
about House of the Dragon.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:19.270
HBO just announced on Game of Thrones official
twitter account

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:23.120
that Game of Thrones prequel series, House
of the Dragon, casted major roles and picked

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:28.230
season 1 directors. We are talking about the
main characters that are going to play a major

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:33.490
role in this prequel such as Daemon and Rhaenyra
Targaryen and Alicent Hightower.

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:37.400
Real quick before we go into it, I know and
understand that some of you might not be too

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:42.510
happy with the casting for House of the Dragon,
but let me tell you this: While the lead cast

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:47.570
is announced and confirmed, it's definitely
not final yet. You see, Game of Thrones prequel

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:52.260
starts filming in about 40 days, and during
the filming, there might be some changes if

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:56.750
they don't prove to be the best choice.
For example, during the first filming of Game

00:00:56.750 --> 00:01:00.719
of Thrones, several actors, major and minor
were replaced.

00:01:00.719 --> 00:01:05.980
Tamzin Merchant originally played Daenerys
Targaryen, but she was replaced by Emilia

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:09.820
Clarke.
Jennifer Ehle originally played Catelyn Stark,

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:14.270
but was replaced by Michelle Fairley.
In other words, if these lead actors don't

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:18.460
prove to be the best possible choice,
they will be replaced during the filming of

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:21.920
House of the Dragon.
House of the Dragon is a Game of Thrones prequel

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:25.280
show that is confirmed by HBO’s president
to air in 2022.

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:30.790
It is based on George RR Martin’s book Fire
And Blood volume 1 and on Martin’s yet unfinished

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:34.650
Fire And Blood volume 2 book.
“Fire &amp; Blood begins their tale with the

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:39.500
legendary Aegon the Conqueror, creator of
the Iron Throne, and goes on to recount the

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:44.250
generations of Targaryens who fought to hold
that iconic seat, all the way up to the civil

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:48.910
war that nearly tore their dynasty apart.”
Thats Fire And Blood volume 1.

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:54.370
The yet unreleased Fire And Vlood volume 2
will continue from where part 1 ended, with

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:59.960
Rhaenyra Targaryen's son Aegon lll's reign
and will cover Blackyre rebellions, war with

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:05.430
Dorne and go all the way to the Mad King and
Robert's Rebellion that ended Targaryen dynasty.

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:10.060
Key event of the prequel will be the Dance
of the Dragon, a Targaryen civil war.

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:15.879
Miguel Sapochnik and Ryan Condal will serve
as showrunners and executive producers. George

00:02:15.879 --> 00:02:18.860
R. R. Martin will also serve as executive
producer.

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:22.990
The Dance of the Dragons was the most devastating
war in the history of the Seven Kingdoms.

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:28.340
A war of succession between Aegon II and his
half-sister Rhaenyra over their father Viserys

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:31.310
I's throne.
Both of them thought they belonged on the

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:35.700
Iron Throne. When people started declaring
for one of them or the other, their fight

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:40.820
divided the kingdoms in two.
Targaryens fought Targaryens, bothers fought

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:45.700
brothers, dragons fought dragons. By the time
it was over, thousands were dead. The conflict

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:50.230
would prove to be incredibly destructive for
not only House Targaryen, but large parts

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:55.701
of Westeros as well. In addition, it devastated
the Targaryen's dragon population, ultimately

00:02:55.701 --> 00:03:00.310
leading to their extinction within a few decades.
Rhaenyra is one of the main characters in

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:03.310
the Targaryen civil war at the heart of the
show.

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:08.680
Emma D'Arcy is casted to play her. Casting
call described her as: “King Viserys’

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:11.730
chosen heir,
a dragon rider who grew up expecting to become

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:16.180
the first ruling Queen of Westeros.”
The official description describes her as

00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:20.010
“the king’s first-born child, she is of
pure Valyrian blood,

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:24.560
and she is a dragonrider. Many would say that
Rhaenyra was born with everything…

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:28.331
but she was not born a man.”
Princess Rhaenyra Targaryen, cheered as the

00:03:28.331 --> 00:03:33.600
Realm's Delight when she was young and later
called the Half-Year Queen, was the first-born

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:39.640
child of King Viserys I Targaryen. Rhaenyra
was King Viserys I's only living child by

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:45.160
his first wife, Queen Aemma of House Arryn.
At the age of eight she was made her father's

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:51.690
heir and grew up expecting to become the first
ruling Queen of Westeros. Rhaenyra was a dragonrider

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:55.990
whose mount was Syrax.
Rhaenyra had her family's Valyrian looks,

00:03:55.990 --> 00:04:02.190
wearing her silver-gold hair in a long braid
in the manner of Queen Visenya Targaryen.

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:06.730
Beautiful as a child, Rhaenyra was later declared
by her uncle, Prince Daemon Targaryen, to

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:10.000
be the most beautiful maiden in all the Seven
Kingdoms.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:16.280
Due to the lack of a male heir, Viserys designated
Rhaenyra as his successor. Therefore, Rhaenyra

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:21.099
was the only female Targaryen to lay claim
to the Iron Throne in her own right.

00:04:21.099 --> 00:04:26.410
Since she was raised as the designated heir,
Rhaenyra became quite pampered and arrogant,

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:32.699
but also gained practical governmental experience.
After Rhaenyra's mother died, her father remarried

00:04:32.699 --> 00:04:38.439
and had several sons by his second wife, Alicent
of House Hightower. Even so, Viserys still

00:04:38.439 --> 00:04:43.780
publicly expected his daughter to succeed
him, and when he died, his official will even

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:50.009
stated so. However, Rhaenyra's younger half-brother,
Aegon, challenged her claim. He stated that

00:04:50.009 --> 00:04:54.419
the normal inheritance laws of the Andals
(which formed the basis of the unified law

00:04:54.419 --> 00:04:59.990
code in Westeros) called for male-preference
primogeniture, meaning that a younger son

00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:05.469
would rightfully inherit before an older daughter.
At the time of her father's death, Rhaenyra

00:05:05.469 --> 00:05:10.819
was on Dragonstone awaiting the birth of her
child. The greens in King's Landing ensured

00:05:10.819 --> 00:05:14.610
that the news of the Viserys's death did not
reach her until her own supporters in the

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:20.169
Red Keep were dead or imprisoned and Aegon
II's coronation had already occurred.

00:05:20.169 --> 00:05:25.430
This began a devastating civil war that tore
apart the Seven Kingdoms, known as The Dance

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:29.759
of the Dragons, as it was the only war in
which both sides had dragonriders.

00:05:29.759 --> 00:05:35.229
Rhaenyra had 2 husbands and 5 sons. Her fist
husband was Laenor of House Velayrion,

00:05:35.229 --> 00:05:40.150
son of the Sea Snake, and her second husband
was her uncle, Daemon Targaryen, the Rogue

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:42.759
Prince,
and there we come to the second announced

00:05:42.759 --> 00:05:47.870
lead actor: Matt Smith will play Daemon.
George R.R. Martin revealed that Daemon is

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:52.100
his favorite Targaryen,
so that tells you something about the character.

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:57.150
HBO describes the character as the “younger
brother to King Viserys and heir to the throne.

00:05:57.150 --> 00:06:02.569
A peerless warrior and a dragonrider, Daemon
possesses the true blood of the dragon.

00:06:02.569 --> 00:06:07.270
But it’s said that whenever a Targaryen
is born, the gods toss a coin in the air…”

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:11.009
Daemon Targaryen also known as Prince of the
City, Lord Flea Bottom and the Rogue Prince

00:06:11.009 --> 00:06:16.669
had many titles throughout his life: Prince,
Ser, Commander of the City Watch, Master of

00:06:16.669 --> 00:06:22.309
coin, master of laws, King of the stepstones
and the narrow sea, protector of the realm.

00:06:22.309 --> 00:06:27.309
Daemon was the most contoversial man of his
lifetime, an audacious rogue prince and adventuer

00:06:27.309 --> 00:06:30.479
who seemed made of good and evil in equal
measure.

00:06:30.479 --> 00:06:35.449
There was never a man so loved and so reviled,
and at a same time, as he was.

00:06:35.449 --> 00:06:40.099
During the Dance of the Dragons, as the husband
of his niece Rhaenyra, he supported his wife's

00:06:40.099 --> 00:06:44.529
claim, and he was considered by many the most
dangerous man in Westeros.

00:06:44.529 --> 00:06:49.620
He was Rhaenyra's second husband, following
Ser Laenor Velaryon and she was his third

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:52.300
wife.
Prince Daemon was the most experienced warrior

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:57.509
of his time and wielded the Valyrian steel
blade Dark Sister. A dragonrider whose dragon

00:06:57.509 --> 00:07:02.529
was Caraxes, Daemon declared himself the King
of the Stepstones and the Narrow Sea.

00:07:02.529 --> 00:07:06.939
Daemon was a skilled warrior, described in
the histories as dashing, daring, and dangerous.

00:07:06.939 --> 00:07:12.869
He was also ambitious, impetuous, mercurial,
amoral, reckless, and quick to take offense.

00:07:12.869 --> 00:07:17.289
He is described as being as charming as he
was hot-tempered.

00:07:17.289 --> 00:07:21.749
Daemon's most epic moment comes from the most
epic dragon battle: battle above the Gods

00:07:21.749 --> 00:07:27.689
eye between two most dangerous warriors at
that time, Daemon and Aemond Targaryen and

00:07:27.689 --> 00:07:32.999
their two dragons, which also were the strongest
of all, Vhagar and Caraxes.

00:07:32.999 --> 00:07:38.839
Daemon challenged Aemond, waiting for thirteen
days at Harrenhal until Aemond stopped burning

00:07:38.839 --> 00:07:43.580
the riverlands to come face him.
When Caraxes attacked Vhagar, she ripped upon

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:48.499
his stomach and tore one of his wings, but
then Caraxes fastened his jaws around her

00:07:48.499 --> 00:07:53.849
throat in death grip.
These injuries forced them both to cease flying

00:07:53.849 --> 00:07:58.419
and as they tumbled to the water below, Daemon
dueled Aemond to the death.

00:07:58.419 --> 00:08:04.020
As he never fastened his saddle, Daemon stood
up on Caraxes and leapt at Aemond, whereupon

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:09.159
he drove his Dark Sister through Aemond's
eye and through his neck, just a second before

00:08:09.159 --> 00:08:12.490
hitting the water.
The Battle Above the Gods Eye ended in the

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:18.880
deaths of both riders and both dragons. Daemon
was forty-nine when he died. Unlike Aemond's

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:24.050
body, however, Daemon's was never found. Singers
say that Daemon lived to spend the rest of

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:28.150
his days in secret with Nettles, but most
historians disagree.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:34.130
Last, but not least, HBO also announced that
Olivia Cooke is also a lead actor,

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:38.190
casted to play Alicent Hightower. Alicent
Hightower is described as “the daughter

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:43.680
of Otto Hightower, the Hand of the King, and
the most comely woman in the Seven Kingdoms.

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:48.360
She was raised in the Red Keep, close to the
king and his innermost circle; she possesses

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:52.430
both a courtly grace and a keen political
acumen.”

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:57.389
Alicent Hightower was a member of House Hightower
who became the second wife to King Viserys

00:08:57.389 --> 00:09:02.990
I Targaryen and therefore a Queen of the Targaryen
dynasty. She was the daughter of Ser Otto

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:08.980
Hightower, who had been Hand of the King to
Jaehaerys I, Viserys I, and later his grandson

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:15.100
Aegon II. She was the mother of King Aegon
II, Queen Helaena, Prince Aemond and Prince

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:18.050
Daeron.
Alicent Hightower was in many ways the true

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:22.310
leader of Aegon II's faction during the Dance
of the Dragons.

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:27.180
At first young Rhaenyra and Alicent got along
well, but a rift grew between them as soon

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:32.509
as Alicent produced her own children for Viserys
I, and clearly wanted them to succeed to the

00:09:32.509 --> 00:09:39.930
throne instead of her. Alicent bore Viserys
I four children: Aegon II, Aemond One-Eye,

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:44.529
Daeron the Daring, and Helaena (who became
the sister-wife of Aegon II).

00:09:44.529 --> 00:09:50.460
Over the years of Viserys I's reign, despite
his best efforts, a bitter rivalry grew between

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:56.009
Alicent and Rhaenyra at court, as well as
between their rival factions of supporters.

00:09:56.009 --> 00:10:01.430
In 111 AC, a great tourney was held at King's
Landing on the fifth anniversary of the king’s

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:06.709
marriage to Queen Alicent. At the opening
feast, Alicent wore a green gown, whilst Princess

00:10:06.709 --> 00:10:11.760
Rhaenyra dressed in Targaryen red and black.
Soon afterwards, their respective followers

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:17.420
started dressing in similar colors and styles
to display their political allegiance: Rhaenyra's

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:22.750
faction (the "Princess's followers") wore
black clothing, and Alicent's faction ("the

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:28.199
Queen's followers") wore green clothing .
Ultimately this inspired the nicknames for

00:10:28.199 --> 00:10:32.459
the two factions: "the Blacks and the Greens".
Viserys I publicly and repeatedly made the

00:10:32.459 --> 00:10:36.920
great lords of the realm swear oaths that
Rhaenyra would succeed him on the Iron Throne,

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:41.300
as the first Ruling Queen.
A matter of hours after Viserys I died in

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:46.260
his sleep, however, Alicent staged a coup
- one that she had long been planning down

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:50.149
to the fine details.
One night, a servant found the old king had

00:10:50.149 --> 00:10:53.660
died in his sleep and ran to inform Queen
Alicent.

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:58.199
Protocol dictated that the bells would be
rung, everyone notified and a raven sent to

00:10:58.199 --> 00:11:03.949
Dragonstone to summon the heir, Princess Rhaenyra,
for her coronation. But Alicent had other

00:11:03.949 --> 00:11:08.600
plans. Once she saw her dead husband's body,
she sealed the room and had the servant thrown

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:13.740
into the Black Cells to ensure his silence.
According to Mushroom, who was away with Rhaenyra

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:17.699
Targaryen on Dragonstone, Alicent poisoned
Viserys's drink.

00:11:17.699 --> 00:11:23.089
True or not, instead of announcing Viserys
I's death immediately, Alicent warned Ser

00:11:23.089 --> 00:11:29.029
Criston Cole, now Lord Commander of the Kingsguard,
and together, they called the small council

00:11:29.029 --> 00:11:34.360
to discuss the succession, where plans were
made to crown Alicent's son Prince Aegon,

00:11:34.360 --> 00:12:00.839
instead of Princess Rhaenyra, who had been
Viserys's heir.

00:12:00.839 --> 00:12:04.370
This started the Targaryen civil war which
will be the key event of the upcoming Game

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:09.680
of Thrones prequel, House of the Dragon. We
also know the directors for the first season.

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:13.750
In addition to Game of Thrones veteran Miguel
Sapochnik, who’s serving as showrunner

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:18.860
along with Ryan Condal, the directing team
will also include Clare Kilner, Geeta Patel

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:22.850
and Greg Yaitanes.
The first season is confirmed to consist of

00:12:22.850 --> 00:12:27.589
ten episodes. House of the Dragon is coming!
Thank you so much for watching, hope you enjoyed

00:12:27.589 --> 00:12:30.133
this video and if you did make sure to give
it a big thumbs upand I hope to see you in

00:12:30.133 --> 00:12:30.399
the next one, peace!

